Source acknowledgments
----------------------
The dataset is compiled from publicly accessible sources. Their underlying
data remain subject to the policies of the original publishers:

  - SofaScore (https://www.sofascore.com) — competition + stadium metadata
  - hrnogomet.hr (https://www.hrnogomet.hr) — Croatian football club registry
  - HNS Semafor (https://semafor.hns.family) — official Croatian FA scoreboard
  - Registar udruga RH (https://registri-npo-mpu.gov.hr) — Croatian NGO register
  - OpenStreetMap / Nominatim — geocoded coordinates (© OSM contributors, ODbL)
  - Google Places API — cross-verified coordinates (subject to Google ToS)

This repository does not redistribute the source data directly. The exporter
scripts produce derivative aggregations from the SQLite catalog, and the
catalog itself is built by the ingest scripts at runtime against the listed
public endpoints.

